     return `Python checks the loop header on Line ${nextStep.line}, sees the loop condition is finished, and exits the loop.`;\n474:     }\n475:     if (nextStep.eventType === \"RETURN\") {\n476:       return `Python moves to Line ${nextStep.line} (\\`${nextCode}\\`) to return the result and exit the local function scope.`;\n477:     }\n478:     return `Python moves to Line ${nextStep.line} and evaluates \\`${nextCode}\\`.`;\n479:   }\n480: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
